// construction (neither capture can be R1-quiescent w.r.t. the
// other)". Slice-1 waves are sequential, but the static quiescence
// proof only exists within one function body's linear order: two
// waves in DIFFERENT functions have no provable J(W₁)→capture(W₂)
// edge, so neither capture is certified quiescent — the checked
